  "title": "Loot Ledger",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "tags": [
    "hash map",
    "sorting"
  ],
  "description": "Every entry in `changes` is `[item, amount]`: a positive amount adds that many of the item to the inventory and a negative amount removes them.\n\nReturn the final inventory as a list of `[item, count]` pairs for items whose final count is greater than zero, sorted by item name.",
